  "title": "Guided-RLVR: Guided Exploration in Reinforcement Learning with Verifiable Rewards",
  "summary": "Guided-RLVR introduces a novel approach to explore and enhance the reasoning capabilities of large language models (LLMs) by augmenting reinforcement learning with verifiable rewards with a lightweight controller, encouraging exploration of multiple reasoning trajectories. This method improves performance on tasks such as mathematics and code generation benchmarks.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Guided-RLVR enhances the exploration of reasoning trajectories by strategically injecting semantically meaningful steering tokens into the sampling distribution.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Guided-RLVR shows strong empirical gains in improving reasoning ability of LLMs on tasks such as mathematics and programming, while maintaining verifiability of rewards.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Experiments demonstrate that Guided-RLVR consistently outperforms existing RLVR methods and produces more diverse reasoning trajectories.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
